  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Warriors Zulu Nation in San Pedro Sula, Honduras, is a youth organization that works with children and young people through hip-hop, art, and culture. Through artistic expression, such as dance, music, and visual arts, the project strengthens young people&#x2019;s engagement with gender equality, climate action, and violence prevention. It aims to raise awareness of community challenges and to empower youth activism and participation, enabling young people to influence and contribute to solutions for the issues they face.</narrative>
  </description>
